WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,810 --> 00:00:03,530
Why did you move these down?

2
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:05,960
These are the supplies I stocked up before the disaster.

3
00:00:05,960 --> 00:00:07,880
It's too cold upstairs for storage.

4
00:00:07,880 --> 00:00:08,880
I want to put you here

5
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:10,480
You can use it if you need it.

6
00:00:10,980 --> 00:00:12,260
Such a valuable thing

7
00:00:12,260 --> 00:00:14,900
Just leave it here with me at ease

8
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:28,980
Wu Steel Tai Steel

9
00:00:28,980 --> 00:00:31,340
One piece can be exchanged for two thousand points, right?

10
00:00:31,740 --> 00:00:33,220
What your base really wants to collect

11
00:00:33,220 --> 00:00:35,420
Are these rare metals smart?

12
00:00:35,740 --> 00:00:37,020
Common supplies are easy to find

13
00:00:37,020 --> 00:00:38,500
Rare metals are too difficult to collect

14
00:00:38,620 --> 00:00:39,940
A lot of military equipment and weapons

15
00:00:39,940 --> 00:00:40,980
All these materials are needed

16
00:00:40,980 --> 00:00:42,260
That's why soldiers are willing to pay high prices

17
00:00:42,260 --> 00:00:43,700
I happen to have a lot of metal in my space

18
00:00:43,700 --> 00:00:44,740
Get some in exchange for points

19
00:00:44,740 --> 00:00:46,340
Let Zhuang Yan help exchange weapons

20
00:00:46,340 --> 00:00:47,300
It's a good deal

21
00:00:47,300 --> 00:00:48,500
Just have to be low-key

22
00:00:48,500 --> 00:00:51,060
You should go there as soon as possible before the trading center officially announces it on a large scale.

23
00:00:51,060 --> 00:00:52,500
Convenient to exchange when there are few people
